<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has lifted sanctions on Jorge Rodríguez, the president of Venezuela’s National Assembly, easing pressure on the opposition leadership. A major oil deal that could have supplied power to Venezuela has been halted, reducing the country’s energy prospects. Cuba’s electricity grid is collapsing, worsening regional energy strain that affects Venezuela. Families of two Trinidadians are demanding accountability from the United States for actions linked to the crisis. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/14/us-lifts-sanctions-on-venezuelas-top-legislator?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQVXFnM3A0T3lJeVdPVnZrVlZHT3l6dlBUbjZkZGdmYTd4NTFkZEE1TkpOVkNxaXpoZVBiQUNSNWhrRGl4cXZxS2VWeHN5aVVfbEpSR2doM0xwR1JiZHA5VjdkLVhrVHhBMTlNQmQ1ZGNOSGd1bDhFOEFFQlpveFRpcG43MUZ1OEwwWGxqeXFrLUNwakUxOTU5R19rZEFTQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOOTlvMUpXbDJXOFQ2QXFGcm03VjFVMEx6anJzUkZIc2c1Ml84dWU5SkFKODUzelpWbnQ3UnIxY3NYZWpNaFcxV01jaTZwckZyLVlBRll1b1kxUGhseGpoV0M0RERCNlJQLWNmRnl0SFFWT2JRanlpQXJjZlNycWc5ZUhTMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOX0dPTzMxQmZlR2ROS0E2T3czWFg4ZVNHb1A3NG9fdmFsQzdhSG5YOTBMVHgxZzEyeTJpaWZYMHNuaW52WlZmNHItb1hmR2xha1ZtemVjSkw4U2psUzdNRVFGTmFUQXVJRmJudGVPMzFSRnFtSUhrQ1F3b3lvTERwVjI1VkkzUXZnaUo5U2Z3ZWRxNnl4S1ppRFJ6RlJ3WkZUNFpjZkM2OUw0NnV4MG5yUVQ1Zms0N25od1NySEZIUERMMjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxORzZIUm1ZM2hkWVlMRFM1eWRTSHVNeDhoWHgwMTBMV0RCX21RckdNSkVvM1AxeUIySjliN1pSYno2OG0zdXpwYVFYaEFqVWdWQTlnSVM2OUlvUHBfSHNPVHU